# One-time TestFlight release trigger.

This marker intentionally triggers the protected iOS App Store release workflow
without merging the Capacitor branch into the production PWA branch.

Retry 1: use the Apple Distribution identity for the Release archive.

Retry 2: let authenticated automatic signing select the distribution identity.

Retry 3: create temporary distribution signing assets through the App Store Connect API and revoke them after upload.

Retry 4: install the generated signing files from their deterministic temporary paths.

Retry 5: export the temporary certificate in Apple Keychain-compatible PKCS#12 format.

Retry 6: export with the same explicit manual profile used by the successful signed archive.

